WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.120
In the Bhagavad Gita, Krishna speaks to
the warrior Arjuna about what dies at

2
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:06.210
death.

3
00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:08.610
He uses an everyday image.

4
00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:12.830
A person lays worn-out robes
away, and puts on new ones.

5
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.900
Many Hindus believe the true
self passes through many lives:

6
00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.440
human, animal and more.

7
00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:24.830
If you have lived many times before,
what are you trying to escape, and how?

8
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:29.090
In this mission, you'll meet three Hindu
schools that picture the goal in different

9
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.000
ways.

10
00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.180
Then you'll follow three paths: knowledge,

11
00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:35.260
action and devotion.

12
00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:39.140
Your mission: find out what
many Hindus hope to escape,

13
00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:40.750
and how they hope to do it.
